# Signalstack Rock (CIPlay signalstack_rock): the shelf, the relay log, the Receiver's plans (relay desk), the mast top,
# the antenna's plans (mast box), the fourth fragment. The shelf's stores chest has pine seeds.
island Signalstack Rock
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Fragments
zone shelf
expect step 1
read Relay log: fragments
expect step 2
open Relay desk
wait 3
expect step 4
open Relay stores
wait 2
expect item Seed_Pine 2
read Post for the relay
read A QSL card
expect step 5
walk 6 -10 to 8.5 -6 to 8.5 -2 to 7.5 1.5 to 6.5 3.8 to 5.2 5.6 to 4 5.5 to 3 5 to 1 3 h=9
zone mast_top
expect step 6
# REDO 10-24: the mast box is in the ice until the three guy clamps are on the winch
expect hidden mastbox
use mastwinch
expect story mastfixed 0
open Ledge chest
open Drift chest
wait 2
expect story clamp 3
expect step 7
use mastwinch
expect story clamp 0
expect shown mastbox
expect step 8
# DEEP 10-24: the star lock (M26) - the Needle, the operator's cave, the beacon tower, the charts and the dome
open Mast box
expect step 8
read Star chart 1/4
read Star chart 2/4
read Star chart 3/4
zone needle_foot
expect step 9
zone operator_cave
read Operator's diary
expect step 10
read The sealed order
expect step 11
zone beacon_top
expect step 12
read Star chart 4/4
read The star dome
open Beacon chest
code mastpad 1234 wrong
expect story starcode 0
code mastpad 4186
expect story starcode 1
expect step 13
open Mast box
wait 3
expect step 15
read Fragment 4
expect done
# the extras: the operator's kit, the keeper's ruin and its hatch, the plane, the sunk supply boat, two treasures
open Operator's kit
read Keeper's list
use ruinhatch
open Under the hatch
open Mail plane's crate
read A letter in the mail sack
zone grey_cove
air coveair
open Supply boat's chest
dig 0
dig 1
